### CREATE five documents.
POST http://localhost:3000/buckets HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "bucketTitle": "Things to do before 50",
    "bucketActivity": "Go skydiving",
    "targetYear": 2024,
    "deadlineDate": "2044-07-28"
}


