### RETRIEVE all documents.
GET http://localhost:3000/buckets HTTP/1.1



### RETRIEVE a document by its ID.
### Replace the following ID with one that exists in the collection.
GET http://localhost:3000/buckets/665418e00a2585f35ee219b1 HTTP/1.1


### UPDATE one document's targetYear, by ID.
### Replace the ID in the following request with one that exists
### and update the targetYear:
PUT http://localhost:3000/buckets/66541401a22eabd8f4c31d65 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "bucketTitle": "Things to do before 50",
    "bucketActivity": "Go skydiving",
    "targetYear": 2033,
    "deadlineDate": "English"
}

### DELETE by ID (responds with nothing if successful):
DELETE http://localhost:3000/buckets/66541401a22eabd8f4c31d65 HTTP/1.1



### RETRIEVE all documents (responds with 4 or the original 5):
GET http://localhost:3000/buckets HTTP/1.1

